  "body": "### 🦋 Changeset detected\n\nLatest commit: eee12e16777b5f53e4ebc25db6b28678b4fb183e\n\n**The changes in this PR will be included in the next version bump.**\n\n<details><summary>This PR includes changesets to release 1 package</summary>\n\n  | Name            | Type  |\n| --------------- | ----- |\n| @langchain/core | Patch |\n\n</details>\n\nNot sure what this means? [Click here to learn what changesets are](https://changesets.dev/faq).\n\n[Click here if you're a maintainer who wants to add another changeset to this PR](https://github.com/simin-yuan/langchainjs/new/fix/core-truncated-streamed-tool-calls?filename=.changeset/cozy-birds-sleep.md&value=---%0A%22%40langchain%2Fcore%22%3A%20patch%0A---%0A%0Afix(core)%3A%20don't%20turn%20truncated%20streamed%20tool-call%20arguments%20into%20a%20tool%20call%0A)\n\n",
